Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.57,0:00:24.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as there are people\Nwho seek freedom in this life,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.03,0:00:27.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,these things shall not\Nvanish from the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.73,0:00:37.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People tell me my head's in the clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.61,0:00:40.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care what they say\Nbecause I'm dreaming of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.97,0:00:43.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are the treasure I found.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.65,0:00:46.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So bright, so bold, it's so elusive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.75,0:00:48.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's hard to look away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.83,0:00:51.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though it's blinding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.95,0:00:55.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are no words to\Ndescribe how I feel inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.79,0:00:58.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really, really stuck on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.23,0:01:02.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to follow my dreams,\Nhowever crazy they seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.63,0:01:05.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I won't stop till I\Nget there, you will see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.69,0:01:08.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all I need to have\Nthe strength to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.99,0:01:12.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Believe in wonderland.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.89,0:01:21.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna follow my dreams,\Nhowever crazy they seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.19,0:01:24.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna share them\Nwith you, a love so true.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.25,0:01:27.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all I want,\Ntogether we can move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.65,0:01:29.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We live how we want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.01,0:01:32.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is no limit to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.13,0:01:33.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have the power of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.65,0:01:36.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't wanna live ordinary life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.71,0:01:39.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have a chance to live in paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.79,0:01:42.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We live in one another.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:49.98,0:01:55.87,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(700,0)\bord2\blur0.5\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(655,700,\1a&H00&)}{Okama Bon Kurei - OG}Okama Kenpo{Ravenfire}
Dialogue: 2,0:01:49.98,0:01:55.87,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(700,0)\bord0\c&HE6E6E6&\blur0.5\4a&HFF&}{Okama Bon Kurei - OG}Okama Kenpo{Ravenfire}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.99,0:02:04.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.07,0:02:09.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koza! Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.93,0:02:12.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm fine. Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.01,0:02:15.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That bullet from Nanohana is still in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.43,0:02:16.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,None of that matters now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.07,0:02:18.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a battlefield we're on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.87,0:02:21.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to stay focused\Non what's happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.41,0:02:22.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.81,0:02:24.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd like to get to one of their horses.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.87,0:02:27.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we can make our way down this\Nstreet and through the center of town,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.91,0:02:31.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then we'll be at the North\NBlock where the Royal Palace is.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.45,0:02:34.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you planning, Koza?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.17,0:02:35.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why go to the palace?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.65,0:02:39.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To reach the king and demand\Nthat he surrender to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.37,0:02:40.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that's insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.69,0:02:43.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The main force of the Royal Army\Nis stationed in the North Block,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.63,0:02:45.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and what's more, they're\Nled by Chaka and Pell.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.05,0:02:47.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think of the danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.17,0:02:50.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we haven't even managed to\Ngather all of our forces together.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.65,0:02:52.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you think it would\Nbe a better idea to wait?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.75,0:02:55.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until reinforcements\Narrive here to help we
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.13,0:02:59.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,can't it's already too\Nlate for that now come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.37,0:03:02.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, Koza.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.61,0:03:16.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holt are you aligned with the rebel army?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.97,0:03:22.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only thing ahead of here in the\Nnorth block is the royal palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.19,0:03:24.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you understand me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.51,0:03:29.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you aren't a part of the battle\Nleave this area of town at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.33,0:03:31.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey are you listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.35,0:03:32.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This place is no playground.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.05,0:03:33.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.96,0:03:35.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.27,0:03:41.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Princess Vivi it can't\Nbe is it really her?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.03,0:03:46.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's my father?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.19,0:03:48.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need him now. Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.39,0:03:50.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.11,0:03:53.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I can't see him then take me to Chaka.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.49,0:03:57.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's something that he must do.
