Dialogue: 2,0:04:07.71,0:04:14.84,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1450,0)\bord0\blur0.5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fsp3\fscx90\fscy105\pos(720,540)\4a&HFF&}Mr. 2 Bon Kurei vs. Sanji
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.73,0:04:22.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.61,0:04:27.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was quite a kick.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.49,0:04:30.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This one can compete with\Nmy ballet kenpo moves.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.11,0:04:32.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.02,0:04:34.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.33,0:04:38.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I already told you, if you want to get\Nby, you'll have to defeat me first.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.33,0:04:41.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you realize all your\Nefforts will be in vain.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.73,0:04:44.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All my life I have\Npracticed these dance moves.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.11,0:04:47.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have perfected the dancer's\Ngrateful art of ballet
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.57,0:04:50.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kenpo and it is unbeatable\Neven by the likes of...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.37,0:04:51.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.47,0:04:57.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just give up, it's no\Nuse trying to escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.69,0:05:00.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ballet Kenpo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.53,0:05:18.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I Degenerate Swan Death Recycle!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.73,0:05:27.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This dance isn't getting me anywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.67,0:05:30.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to settle this once and for all!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.65,0:05:34.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Collier Shoot! Un!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.23,0:05:36.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hit me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.85,0:05:38.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Complete!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.69,0:05:41.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Saul!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.01,0:05:44.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On three!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.31,0:05:46.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.35,0:05:49.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ballet get ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.73,0:05:54.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Automate shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.59,0:05:55.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not a pass!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.01,0:06:18.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My Montblanc shot, blocked by that clown.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.83,0:06:24.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My ultimate swan at a vest, stopped\Nby that stupid, insignificant cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.83,0:06:27.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got to be kidding me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.37,0:06:31.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, it's time to get serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.17,0:06:32.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From now on, I mean business.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.41,0:06:33.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.87,0:06:34.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see it, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.67,0:06:40.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't know the true extent\Nof my power yet, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.75,0:06:44.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My most impressive feature is\Nmy ability to remember faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.25,0:06:47.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Using that, I can construct and\Ndisplay an incredible montage!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.79,0:06:52.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you see this, you will laugh\Nhelplessly until you collapse!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.47,0:06:57.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To begin, the world's\Nmost ridiculous head!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.93,0:07:00.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then, the world's most ridiculous eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.01,0:07:02.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The most ridiculous nose!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.01,0:07:06.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and in the world's most ridiculous mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.03,0:07:09.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now take a good long look,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.33,0:07:14.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,experience the grand unveiling\Nof the Cape Cape Montage.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.85,0:07:28.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,About 90 % of that was\Nyour own ridiculous face.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.71,0:07:31.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.01,0:07:35.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop playing dress-up, you ugly freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.21,0:07:36.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you have a heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.29,0:07:38.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a brilliant artist, you big jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.57,0:07:43.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have time to mess around with\Nyour childish little tricks anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.69,0:07:44.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tricks, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.60,0:07:45.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.23,0:07:47.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They aren't just tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.33,0:07:48.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just wait until you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.11,0:07:49.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Within my art,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.07,0:07:53.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there lies the power of the greatest\Nfriendships and the truest loves.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.61,0:07:54.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.27,0:07:56.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see what you're planning now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.91,0:07:59.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We all need love, and friends,\Nfriends are so important.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.69,0:08:01.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It really just isn't\Ngoing to work, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.59,0:08:03.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, let's see you hurt me. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.51,0:08:06.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.19,0:08:09.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just attacked your little\Nfriend with a long nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.85,0:08:13.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, then, clearly you don't\Nvalue friendship much, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.95,0:08:15.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a real idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.49,0:08:19.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter what you transform your face\Nto look like, you're still only you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.83,0:08:23.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not the kind to be fooled\Nby images and facades like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.07,0:08:25.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.63,0:08:28.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A person is their soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.01,0:08:33.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is there a soul?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.25,0:08:38.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's so... wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.45,0:08:44.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so embarrassed to have been\Nso caught up with appearances.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.29,0:08:45.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.73,0:08:47.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if I was to become...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.73,0:08:51.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her, for instance, it wouldn't\Nmake any difference to you at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.47,0:08:53.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because images don't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.21,0:09:03.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, he's easy to read.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.15,0:09:06.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are such a fool!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:07.30,0:09:14.26,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(480,0)\bord4.3\blur0.5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fsp3\fscx90\fscy105\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(435,480,\1a&H00&)\pos(720,681.1)}Alubarna Palace
Dialogue: 2,0:09:07.30,0:09:14.26,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(480,0)\bord0\blur0.5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fsp3\fscx90\fscy105\4a&HFF&\pos(720,681.1)}Alubarna Palace
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.35,0:09:09.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.27,0:09:13.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Vivi! It's true! Princess\NVivi has come back. But why now?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.53,0:09:22.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But princess vivi, that's insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.47,0:09:25.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't do something like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.53,0:09:30.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you afraid\Nwould happen if we did?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.71,0:09:34.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the kingdom would\Nsimply die. You're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.19,0:09:37.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It wouldn't this palace\Nis not alabasta after all
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.93,0:09:42.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alabasta is
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.81,0:10:01.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is the people who are out\Nthere hurting each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.49,0:10:06.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They are the ones who made Alabasta\Na country in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.27,0:10:10.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If there is any chance of stopping\Nthis war, then we must take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.35,0:10:16.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, Chaka, we only need to draw\Neveryone's eyes over here for a few seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.51,0:10:20.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you can do that, then\NI will take it from there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.59,0:10:22.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear I can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.21,0:10:32.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For now, please, destroy this palace!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.09,0:10:42.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you can't be serious, Princess Vivi!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.37,0:10:46.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The palace has stood in the\Nsame spot for 4,000 years!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.43,0:10:48.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please don't go through with\Nthis plan, Princess Vivi!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.83,0:10:51.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chaka, you have to use your best judgment!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.73,0:10:53.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The king isn't even here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.71,0:10:56.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't possibly do\Nthis without his approval!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.93,0:11:05.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sire, we must take action against the\Nrebels quickly before it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.99,0:11:07.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is not some little quarrel.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.15,0:11:10.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we strike first, they will strike back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.43,0:11:12.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you suggesting that\Nwe attack our citizens
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.85,0:11:15.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,before we determine who's behind all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.05,0:11:19.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because that would be the true\Ndestruction of our kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.23,0:11:21.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we will act.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.65,0:11:24.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We will head out for\NRain Base and Crocodile.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.09,0:11:28.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, attacking Crocodile\Nnow will only make things worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.41,0:11:32.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It will only add fuel to\Nthe Rebel Army's fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.45,0:11:34.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we leave for Rain Base now,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.29,0:11:38.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Rebel Army will use our absence as\Na perfect chance to attack the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.43,0:11:42.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter if the Rebel Army\Ndestroys this palace completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.17,0:11:43.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is only a building.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.13,0:11:44.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.33,0:11:49.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even if our royal army does fall in the\Nend, if we can just defeat Crocodile,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.51,0:11:53.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this country can still be reborn as\Nlong as its people are safe and whole.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.49,0:11:57.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we battle the rebel army\Ninstead, then that will all change.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.23,0:12:05.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember, the people are the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.01,0:12:11.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Princess Vivi!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.39,0:12:21.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I will do as you say. You're just\Nwhat they mean when they say he's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.47,0:12:26.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but talk I bet you don't have enough\Nstrength left to get up don't think for a
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.85,0:12:31.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,second that I'm just gonna lie down and\Ngive up you may look like not me on the
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.11,0:12:32.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,outside but you're still the same idiot
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.75,0:12:38.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the inside, you bastard. I'll show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.17,0:12:46.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.81,0:12:48.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's too cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.43,0:12:49.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.55,0:12:51.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This desert air is so stifling.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.75,0:12:54.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It just makes me want to\Nrip all my clothes off.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.91,0:12:56.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.53,0:12:58.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The late chop!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.91,0:13:01.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ow, my eye!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.77,0:13:03.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a good one!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.35,0:13:05.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kick point!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.03,0:13:16.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, nothing but talk, are ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.49,0:13:20.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll show you talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.05,0:13:23.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nobody messes with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.11,0:13:25.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, Mascara.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.11,0:13:26.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Overing!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.57,0:13:30.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eat this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.31,0:13:33.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, don't kick me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.37,0:13:34.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.03,0:13:43.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The eyes have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.03,0:13:48.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, this has been a treat,\Nbut alas, I must be off.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.19,0:13:50.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Duty calls and I've\Ngot a princess to kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.61,0:13:54.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really hate to rush things, but I'm\Ngoing to have to finish you off now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.57,0:13:59.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stand right there, lover boy,\Nand I'll make this quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.71,0:14:05.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Round and round and round\NI go, and when I stop...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.35,0:14:11.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute, did you just say we're\Nsupposed to blow up the royal palace?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.17,0:14:12.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that it sounds crazy,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.55,0:14:14.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but those are the orders that\Njust came down from high command!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.05,0:14:17.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've been ordered to blow up the palace!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.03,0:14:19.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They can't be serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.89,0:14:22.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That palace is 4,000 years old!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.39,0:14:32.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing I can say can express\Nmy sorrow at all of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.77,0:14:34.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's alright, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.65,0:14:37.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really have no choice when\Nit comes right down to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.35,0:14:39.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was your duty to\Nintercept the Rebel Army.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.37,0:14:41.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In spite of what happened to Igaram,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.17,0:14:45.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you've done well by managing to keep the\NRebellion in check for the last two years.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.77,0:14:47.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I wasn't wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.69,0:14:51.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've met some true friends who\Nare going to save Alabasta.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.35,0:14:54.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once the Royal Army and\Nthe Rebel Army meet,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.87,0:14:58.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this country, the Kingdom of\NAlabasta, will be gone forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.89,0:15:02.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, if you truly are the one and\Nonly hope for preventing that tragedy,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.51,0:15:04.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then you must survive, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.49,0:15:07.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, from this moment forward,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.65,0:15:12.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what happens to Luffy, or any of us for\Nthat matter, isn't the least bit important.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.49,0:15:19.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of you, who are willing to give\Nyour lives, how are you faring now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.57,0:15:20.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Princess Phoebe,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.81,0:15:23.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in the two years since\Nwe've seen each other,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.27,0:15:25.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you've grown into a beautiful young woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.29,0:15:29.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once this war is behind us,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.21,0:15:33.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all I'd like very much to hold a grand\Nbanquet to honor your pirate friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.83,0:15:38.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chaka, okay then?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.83,0:15:42.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me food after I beat up Crocodile.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.61,0:15:45.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me food, I'll eat till I explode.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.51,0:15:50.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I believe in you, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.63,0:15:52.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.13,0:15:54.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must have defeated Crocodile?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.05,0:15:57.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My lord, Chaka!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.65,0:15:58.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, report.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.23,0:16:02.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it really true that they're\Ngoing to blow up the royal palace?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.31,0:16:04.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The soldiers are getting explosives ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.65,0:16:06.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Surely this must be a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.35,0:16:07.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no mistake, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.75,0:16:09.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That order was given by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.71,0:16:10.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Princess Phoebe!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.89,0:16:13.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Use every ounce of explosives\Nthat you can lay your hands on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.79,0:16:16.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only way to stop this\Nsenseless fighting and to save the
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.77,0:16:21.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,lives of the people of Alabasta\Nis to blow up the royal palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.07,0:16:25.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.07,0:16:32.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see your weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.09,0:16:35.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a flaw in your attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.03,0:16:46.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure enough, I was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.05,0:16:48.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see through it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.83,0:16:50.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You say through what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.39,0:16:53.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What part of my ability could a\Nphilistine like you appreciate?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.81,0:16:56.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let alone see through only this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.43,0:17:01.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That you can't use your precious ballet\NKenpo while you're assuming Nami's form!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.75,0:17:03.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's true!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.66,0:17:06.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't bring myself to attack\Nyou while you look like Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.27,0:17:08.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's pretty clear\Nyou have to return to
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.29,0:17:10.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your normal self before\Nyou try to attack me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.77,0:17:14.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it happens whenever I see you\Ntouch your cheek with your left hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.01,0:17:22.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.92,0:17:24.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't hear you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.63,0:17:26.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm right, aren't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.41,0:17:30.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, so what if you all right, pal?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.57,0:17:31.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, all right,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.93,0:17:35.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's only with this magnificent godlike\Nphysique that I patiently developed,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.69,0:17:38.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,friggin' day after day of\Nrigorous and brutal lessons,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.33,0:17:40.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that I am able to perform my ballet Kenpo.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.27,0:17:41.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But so what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.31,0:17:43.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're still plenty black\Nand blue, aren't you, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.99,0:17:44.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big Talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.90,0:17:49.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, take a look at the\NPrima of Ballet Kenpo.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.31,0:17:51.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll say this much about\Nit, then you're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.61,0:17:55.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The one on your left is the pin,\Nand on your right is the cub.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.51,0:17:56.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.45,0:18:00.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whether you see through\Nit or not doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.05,0:18:03.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, prepare to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.31,0:18:05.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Behold the power of my Ballet Kenpo!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.57,0:18:07.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,FAMURIO!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.93,0:18:12.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.84,0:18:14.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He punched a hole in the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.25,0:18:18.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You dodged it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.53,0:18:19.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Smart thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.81,0:18:22.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At the end of the bench,\Nnecks are still this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.21,0:18:26.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He didn't even crack the\Nplaster around the hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.63,0:18:30.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,True power, when compressed and\Nfocused into a single point of contact,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.35,0:18:32.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,will not destroy anything needlessly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.69,0:18:34.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It might be best if you\Nwere to try thinking of one
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.73,0:18:37.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of my kicks like a shot\Nfrom a high-powered rifle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.47,0:18:41.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, in this case, the bullets\Nare of a drastically higher caliber.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.15,0:18:42.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to perforate you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.45,0:18:47.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Call your...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.47,0:18:50.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.95,0:18:56.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, his reach is longer than mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.39,0:19:01.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like the fight is over!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.47,0:19:03.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm flying like a swan!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.35,0:19:05.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Black and Poe!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.25,0:19:07.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Memoirs of a Winter Sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.55,0:19:14.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the longer his reach is, the\Nlonger it takes him to recover.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.87,0:19:20.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I can avoid his kick, I'll have\Nthat much more time to attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.47,0:19:21.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.45,0:19:30.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And just what do you think\Nyou're gonna do now, lover boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.49,0:19:33.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, something stuck to your\Nleft cheek. Huh? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.69,0:19:36.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Passo!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.43,0:19:43.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.05,0:19:46.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.75,0:20:15.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shit! Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.23,0:20:18.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.14,0:20:18.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.06,0:20:21.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire! Generate! Call again! Shit! Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.59,0:20:53.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God, I'm going to kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.61,0:21:20.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.63,0:21:22.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.99,0:21:23.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.89,0:21:25.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.01,0:21:48.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.92,0:21:49.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.95,0:21:53.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got to be kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.81,0:21:55.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean you're still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.11,0:21:58.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.19,0:22:02.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All you have to do is turn into Nami again,\Nand I won't be able to finish you off.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.27,0:22:03.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.31,0:22:05.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't move with the shape I'm in.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.89,0:22:09.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no point trying to\Navoid the outcome of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.65,0:22:11.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I congratulate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.69,0:22:12.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.85,0:22:16.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.21,0:22:18.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, the rogue works will do it anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.65,0:22:21.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't just stand there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.29,0:22:22.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get it over with.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.99,0:22:24.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, finish me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.53,0:22:30.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was a good fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.77,0:22:34.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And beyond that, we don't\Nneed any more words, do we?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.11,0:22:49.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is without question the deep\Nrespect that arises between rivals.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.35,0:22:50.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I won't cry!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.95,0:22:55.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bye now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.09,0:22:58.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, and I'm taking back\Nour sharpshooter's goggles?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.33,0:23:01.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, he did finish me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.47,0:23:09.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I cracked a\Ncouple of my bones again.
