Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.33,0:23:26.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything is ready as\Nyou ordered, Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.67,0:23:28.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything is set here, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.37,0:23:34.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.28,0:23:38.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This castle has been a part of\NAlabasta's history for 4,000 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.33,0:23:48.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been a great source of pride to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.91,0:23:54.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if we destroy the royal palace,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.45,0:23:57.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the people will have to stop fighting\Nwith each other and pay attention!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.71,0:23:59.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll finally be able to\Ntell everyone the truth
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.61,0:24:02.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,about this horrible\Nconspiracy in my own words.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.53,0:24:06.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, light your fuses!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.61,0:24:20.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.03,0:24:27.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.49,0:24:29.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.40,0:24:32.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,was him...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.55,0:24:35.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't have this
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.87,0:24:48.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was rather treacherous\Non your part, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.43,0:24:50.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, Miss Wednesday.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.05,0:24:54.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, my dear, this\Nis about to be my house.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.77,0:24:56.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'll never let you!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.05,0:25:00.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.01,0:25:01.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.15,0:25:07.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is lovely, to have\Na palace like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.47,0:25:14.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a marvelous place to look down\Non all the filth and rabble below.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.15,0:25:17.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where, where is Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.97,0:25:22.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who's that oh you mean Straw Hat that
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.71,0:25:24.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,miserable young rookie
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.13,0:25:30.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my dear he's dead

